<span id="S4.F4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Training metrics over time.</span>
(<a href="#S4.F4.sf1" title="Figure 4(a) ‣ Figure 4 ‣ Cross-Dataset Performance. ‣ 4.2 Results ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ Tree-OPO: Off-policy Monte Carlo Tree-Guided Advantage Optimization for Multistep Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4(a)</span></a>) Satisfaction rate of prefix-ordering constraints imposed by structured advantage estimation.
(<a href="#S4.F4.sf2" title="Figure 4(b) ‣ Figure 4 ‣ Cross-Dataset Performance. ‣ 4.2 Results ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ Tree-OPO: Off-policy Monte Carlo Tree-Guided Advantage Optimization for Multistep Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4(b)</span></a>) Variance of advantage estimates; lower variance improves update stability.
(<a href="#S4.F4.sf3" title="Figure 4(c) ‣ Figure 4 ‣ Cross-Dataset Performance. ‣ 4.2 Results ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ Tree-OPO: Off-policy Monte Carlo Tree-Guided Advantage Optimization for Multistep Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4(c)</span></a>) Task-specific average rewards during training.
All curves are smoothed; color indicates strategy.
